---
description: Quality bar for all SoftwareFactory work
alwaysApply: true
---

- Prefer the smallest change that satisfies the spec.
- Do not add dependencies, frameworks, or extra files unless they are required.
- Cover new behavior with tests. Run them before you claim the work is done.
- Keep secrets out of the repo. Use placeholders and `.env.example` only.
- Leave existing behavior working unless the spec says to change it.
- Write clear names and short functions. Avoid clever code.
